---
import DemoLayout from '../../../components/demos/DemoLayout.astro';
import Art from '../../../components/demos/Art.astro';
import Comparison from '../../../components/demos/Comparison.astro';
import LocalEnquiry from '../../../components/demos/LocalEnquiry.astro';
const work=[['Finish care','Panel finish study','automotive-one'],['Workshop','Mechanical preparation','automotive-two'],['Finish care','Paint & light study','automotive-three']];
---
<DemoLayout slug="automotive-workshop">
  <section class="demo-hero d-shell"><div class="hero-copy"><p class="d-kicker">Independent workshop / Fictional concept</p><h1>Precision,<br />in every detail.</h1><p class="d-lead">A clear plan for the work your vehicle needs. Explore a workshop experience built around care, communication and the details.</p><div class="d-actions"><a class="d-button" href="#booking">Explore a booking →</a><a class="d-text-button" href="#work">View concept work</a></div></div><div class="hero-media"><Art name="automotive-hero" alt="AI-generated concept image of an unbranded sports coupe in a dark workshop" eager sizes="100vw" /><p class="art-caption">AI-generated image / No real customer vehicle</p></div></section>
  <div class="d-shell workshop-band"><span>Mechanical care</span><span>Finish & detailing</span><span>Clear communication</span><span>Concept workshop</span></div>
  <section class="d-section d-shell" id="services"><div class="d-section-head"><div><p class="d-kicker">01 / Workshop services</p><h2>Care, from the<br />inside out.</h2></div><p>Sample service categories show how a real workshop could explain its scope before a customer books.</p></div><div class="d-grid-3">{[['Routine servicing','A clear overview of scheduled maintenance, with the vehicle and service requirements confirmed before any work.'],['Mechanical inspection','A starting point for discussing a concern, arranging an inspection and explaining the next steps.'],['Detail & finish care','A dedicated space for interior care, paint preparation and presentation work.']].map(([t,p],i)=><article class="d-card"><span class="d-index">0{i+1}</span><h3>{t}</h3><p>{p}</p></article>)}</div></section>
  <section class="d-section d-shell" id="work"><div class="d-section-head"><div><p class="d-kicker">02 / Concept work gallery</p><h2>Details worth a closer look.</h2></div><p>Original concept studies, not completed jobs or evidence of actual workshop results.</p></div><div data-filter-gallery><div class="filter-buttons" role="group" aria-label="Filter workshop concepts">{['all','Finish care','Workshop'].map((c,i)=><button type="button" data-gallery-filter={c} aria-pressed={i===0?'true':'false'}>{c==='all'?'All work':c}</button>)}</div><div class="gallery-cards">{work.map(([c,t,a])=><figure data-gallery-item={c}><Art name={a} alt={`Fictional workshop study: ${t}`} /><figcaption>{t}<span>{c} · Generated concept</span></figcaption></figure>)}</div><p class="gallery-count" data-gallery-count role="status">3 concepts shown</p></div></section>
  <section class="d-section d-shell"><div class="d-grid-2"><div><p class="d-kicker">03 / Explore the finish</p><h2>A small change.<br />A different impression.</h2><p class="d-lead">Move the control to compare two generated finish concepts.</p><p class="demo-note">This interaction demonstrates a before-and-after presentation. It does not represent a real repair or performance claim. Use the arrow keys when the slider is focused.</p></div><Comparison id="car-comparison" before="automotive-four" after="automotive-finish" beforeAlt="Concept car with a muted finish and surface marks" afterAlt="Same concept car with a glossy graphite finish" /></div></section>
  <section class="d-section d-shell" id="process"><p class="d-kicker">04 / How a visit could work</p><h2>No guesswork in the next step.</h2><ol class="d-steps"><li><h3>Tell us the need</h3><p>Describe the vehicle and the reason for your visit.</p></li><li><h3>Agree the scope</h3><p>Discuss the inspection, timing and work to be considered.</p></li><li><h3>Review the plan</h3><p>Approve a real scope and quote before work begins.</p></li><li><h3>Collect & discuss</h3><p>Review the work and any relevant follow-up information.</p></li></ol></section>
  <section class="d-section d-shell"><LocalEnquiry id="booking" title="Plan a workshop visit." kind="booking request" options={['Routine servicing','Mechanical inspection','Detail & finish care']} /></section>
  <section class="d-section d-shell"><div class="contact-strip"><div><p class="d-kicker">Contact the concept workshop</p><h3>A clear route to a conversation.</h3><p>A real version would display verified workshop contact details and opening hours here.</p></div><div><h3>This workshop is fictional.</h3><p>No premises, phone line or bookings are operated by this demo. The booking controls above are a local preview only.</p><a class="d-text-button" href="#booking">Try the booking preview ↑</a></div></div></section>
</DemoLayout>
